WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.929
Most people will see your design on a phone. Let's design for that.

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:08.058
Use square for posts, and vertical for WhatsApp status.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.669
Use few words and big text.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.871
Make the main message readable in the small preview.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:18.487
Export small files, then send it to yourself on WhatsApp to test.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:28.326
Before you move on, check: Design one square and one vertical version. Check the preview is readable. Export a small file. Test on WhatsApp.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:32.520
In the next lesson: Free design tools.
